{"seq":2,"slug":"evaluation-backtesting","title":"评估与回测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/applications/evaluation-backtesting","wordCount":1463,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"评估与回测\">评估与回测</h1><p>有一个让无数团队栽跟头的场景：模型在验证集上 MAPE 只有 3%，上线后却高达 15%。复盘几乎总能找到同一类病根——评估方式骗了自己。要么数据被打乱导致泄漏，要么只在一段「好打的」时期上测过，要么用错了指标。前面每一章都在反复提醒「严格按时间切分」「警惕数据泄漏」「在统一协议下比较」，这一篇把这些散落的原则收拢成一套可操作的方法论。这是整个 hub 的良心：不会回测，前面学的一切都建在沙上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>时间序列评估的第一性原理只有一句：永远不能用未来预测过去。这条铁律推翻了普通机器学习的随机 K 折交叉验证，取而代之的是尊重时间顺序的回测（backtesting）——在多个历史时间点上，假装站在那一刻、只用此前的数据预测此后，再与真实值比对。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[完整序列] --&gt; B{切分方式}&#10;    B --&gt;|扩展窗口| C[训练集逐次增长&lt;br/&gt;测试窗口向后滑]&#10;    B --&gt;|滑动窗口| D[训练集长度固定&lt;br/&gt;整体向后滑]&#10;    C --&gt; E[多折预测]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[每折算指标]&#10;    F --&gt; G[聚合&lt;br/&gt;跨折跨序列]&#10;    G --&gt; H{指标类型}&#10;    H --&gt; I[点预测 MAE/RMSE/MASE]&#10;    H --&gt; J[概率 pinball/CRPS]&#10;    H --&gt; K[校准 覆盖率]\">flowchart TD\n    A[完整序列] --&gt; B{切分方式}\n    B --&gt;|扩展窗口| C[训练集逐次增长&lt;br/&gt;测试窗口向后滑]\n    B --&gt;|滑动窗口| D[训练集长度固定&lt;br/&gt;整体向后滑]\n    C --&gt; E[多折预测]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[每折算指标]\n    F --&gt; G[聚合&lt;br/&gt;跨折跨序列]\n    G --&gt; H{指标类型}\n    H --&gt; I[点预测 MAE/RMSE/MASE]\n    H --&gt; J[概率 pinball/CRPS]\n    H --&gt; K[校准 覆盖率]</pre><p>下表对比两种回测窗口策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>训练集</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>扩展窗口</td>\n<td>逐折增长</td>\n<td>数据珍贵、模式稳定</td>\n<td>早晚两端不可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口</td>\n<td>长度固定</td>\n<td>模式会漂移、要看时效性</td>\n<td>浪费早期数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"滚动回测-核心方法\">滚动回测：核心方法</h2><p>滚动回测是时序评估的金标准。它在序列上选取多个「预测起点」，每个起点处用之前的数据训练（或加载已训模型），预测之后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 步，与真实值比对，最后聚合所有折的指标。这本质上是 <a href=\"../foundations/ts-problem-framing\">时间序列问题建模</a> 里「按时间切分」原则的多次重复执行，好处是评估不依赖单次切分的运气、能反映模型在不同时期的稳定性。</p>\n<p>两种窗口策略对应不同假设。扩展窗口（expanding window）每折把训练集向后延长，模拟「随时间积累越来越多数据」，适合数据珍贵、底层模式稳定的场景。滑动窗口（sliding window）保持训练集长度固定、整体向后平移，强迫模型只用近期数据，适合存在数据漂移、需要评估「模型用多新的数据」的场景——这与 <a href=\"domains-deployment\">行业落地与部署</a> 讨论的再训练节奏直接相关。一个常被忽视的细节是 gap（间隔）：若特征工程用了滚动统计，训练与测试之间要留出空隙，防止 <a href=\"../foundations/preprocessing-features\">预处理与特征工程</a> 里的滚动窗口跨越分界造成泄漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标的正确选择\">指标的正确选择</h2><p>指标定义了「好」的方向，选错就优化错目标。点预测指标各有适用与陷阱：MAE 对离群点稳健、单位直观；RMSE 惩罚大误差、对离群点敏感；MAPE 单位无关但在真实值接近零时爆炸、且对低估高估不对称。跨多条量纲不同的序列聚合时，必须用尺度无关指标。MASE（Mean Absolute Scaled Error）是稳健之选，它以朴素（季节）基线的误差为分母：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MASE</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MASE} = \\frac{\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_t |y_t - \\hat{y}_t|}{\\frac{1}{n-m}\\sum_{t=m+1}^{n} |y_t - y_{t-m}|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MASE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7185em;vertical-align:-1.1384em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2649em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.735em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1384em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>MASE 小于 1 表示优于朴素基线，大于 1 表示还不如——它天然把 <a href=\"../foundations/classical-baselines\">经典基线</a> 编进了分母，逼你时刻和及格线比较。概率预测则用 pinball loss 与 CRPS，并配合覆盖率等校准诊断，完整论述见 <a href=\"../modern/probabilistic-forecasting\">概率预测与分位数</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚合与统计显著性\">聚合与统计显著性</h2><p>算出每折每序列的指标后，如何聚合大有讲究。简单平均会被量纲大的序列主导——一条日销上万的序列的绝对误差会淹没成百条日销几件的序列，因此跨序列聚合务必用尺度无关指标，或按业务重要性加权。此外，两个模型 MASE 相差 0.01 究竟是真本事还是噪声？需要统计检验来回答。Diebold-Mariano 检验专门用于比较两个预测的准确性是否有显著差异；多模型比较时，M 系列竞赛常用的做法是看在多少条序列上一个模型胜出、并报告排名分布。没有显著性意识，就容易把随机波动当成进步——这与 <a href=\"../modern/multivariate-long-horizon\">多变量与长程预测</a> 里「警惕论文榜单 MSE 微小差异」的告诫一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱清单\">常见陷阱清单</h2><p>把最致命的回测陷阱列成检查清单，上线前逐条过：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"[ ] 数据按时间切分 —— 绝不随机打乱，测试段永远在训练段之后&#10;[ ] 统计量只来自训练段 —— 归一化的均值/方差固定自训练集&#10;[ ] 缺口留足 —— gap &gt;= 特征用到的最大滚动窗口&#10;[ ] 滚动回测 —— 至少 3 折，覆盖不同时期，而非单段评估&#10;[ ] 基线在场 —— 与 ARIMA/ETS/季节朴素法并列比较&#10;[ ] 切分不反复挑 —— 定好协议后不再换窗口刷分&#10;[ ] 概率任务看校准 —— 除 pinball/CRPS 外核对区间覆盖率&#10;[ ] 异常检测不用点调整 —— 见 PA 制造虚假高分的警示\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[ ] 数据按时间切分 —— 绝不随机打乱，测试段永远在训练段之后</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[ ] 统计量只来自训练段 —— 归一化的均值/方差固定自训练集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[ ] 缺口留足 —— gap >= 特征用到的最大滚动窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[ ] 滚动回测 —— 至少 3 折，覆盖不同时期，而非单段评估</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[ ] 基线在场 —— 与 ARIMA/ETS/季节朴素法并列比较</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[ ] 切分不反复挑 —— 定好协议后不再换窗口刷分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[ ] 概率任务看校准 —— 除 pinball/CRPS 外核对区间覆盖率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[ ] 异常检测不用点调整 —— 见 PA 制造虚假高分的警示</span></span></code></pre></div><p>其一，随机打乱数据——把未来样本混进训练集，最典型的泄漏。其二，用全局统计量归一化——用含测试集的均值方差标准化，统计量应只来自训练集，见 <a href=\"../foundations/preprocessing-features\">预处理与特征工程</a>。其三，只测一段时期——只在风平浪静的时段评估，遇到节假日或突变就失灵，滚动回测正是为此而生。其四，无基线——不和 <a href=\"../foundations/classical-baselines\">ARIMA/ETS 或季节朴素法</a> 比，无从判断提升真伪。其五，挑选窗口——反复换切分直到指标好看，等于在测试集上调参。其六，对异常检测用点调整——见 <a href=\"anomaly-detection\">异常检测</a> 中关于 PA 制造虚假高分的警告。守住这张清单，评估才配得上「可信」二字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时序评估的铁律是「不用未来预测过去」，用滚动回测取代随机交叉验证。</li>\n<li>扩展窗口适合数据珍贵、模式稳定；滑动窗口适合存在漂移、关注时效。</li>\n<li>点预测跨序列聚合用尺度无关的 MASE（把基线编进分母），概率预测用 pinball/CRPS + 校准。</li>\n<li>聚合警惕大量纲序列主导，模型比较用 Diebold-Mariano 等检验判显著性。</li>\n<li>牢记六大陷阱清单：随机打乱、全局归一化、单期评估、无基线、挑窗口、点调整。</li>\n<li>这套方法论是全 hub 的良心，前面每一篇的「公平比较」都靠它落地。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"评估与回测","id":"评估与回测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"滚动回测：核心方法","id":"滚动回测-核心方法"},{"level":2,"text":"指标的正确选择","id":"指标的正确选择"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合与统计显著性","id":"聚合与统计显著性"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱清单","id":"常见陷阱清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/applications/anomaly-detection"},"next":{"title":"行业落地与部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/applications/domains-deployment"}}